# /cdisc/cosmos/
#
# https://w3id.org/cdisc/cosmos/ is the namespace for an RDF/OWL rendering
# of CDISC COSMoS (Biomedical Concepts and SDTM Dataset Specializations),
# generated mechanically from the artifacts published in cdisc-org/COSMoS,
# plus an authored overlay of qualified biomedical concepts. Slash
# semantics. The namespace names the ontologies, their instance graphs and
# their releases, and the IRIs the repository mints under them; the class
# and property IRIs of the core rendering stay as CDISC published them
# (https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/...) and are not served here.
#
# Segments:
#   bc/            core BC ontology          cosmos_bc_v1
#   bc/instances/  core BC instance graph    cosmos_bc_v1.instances
#   sdtm/          core SDTM ontology        cosmos_sdtm_v1
#   qbc/           overlay ontology          cosmos_qbc_v1
#   qbc/instances/ overlay instance graph    cosmos_qbc_v1.instances
#   dss/           RESERVED, not registered: the Dataset Specialization
#                  instance graph is deferred (cosmos-rdf decision D4). The
#                  IRIs already minted under it (recording subjects) are
#                  stable identity and will resolve when that layer lands;
#                  until then they 404 by design.
#
# Rule: an IRI resolves to a document that has it as subject. A term of
# the overlay ontology (class, property; enum values carry a fragment, so
# the enum is the term) resolves to the ontology; an individual - a
# qualified concept, a scale node, a use-node, a category label-node - to
# its instance graph; an ontology IRI to the ontology at the current
# release; a version IRI (bare-numeric path, e.g. bc/0.3.0) to its own
# release through one generic rule per graph. Fixed paths serve the
# JSON-LD contexts (bc/context.jsonld, sdtm/context.jsonld) and the SHACL
# shapes (bc/shapes, sdtm/shapes, qbc/shapes).
#
# Targets are the GitHub Pages site of kerfors/cosmos-rdf, rebuilt from
# every release tag: /vX.Y.Z/<graph>.{ttl,nt,rdf,jsonld}, Turtle canonical
# and the rest derived from it at deploy. Non-version IRIs go through
# /latest/, a copy of the newest tag written by the same build, so a
# release needs no change here; a version IRI still names its own tag.
# Content negotiation over those four serializations; default (no Accept
# header) is Turtle. A browser asking for an ontology, or for one of the
# overlay's terms, lands on that ontology's WIDOCO documentation - on the
# term's own section, where the term has one - and anywhere else on the
# release index.
#
# Generated by notebooks/80_generate_htaccess.ipynb in kerfors/cosmos-rdf
# and checked by scripts/htaccess_check.py against every IRI the
# deliverables carry. Edit there, not here.
#
# Status: draft, not a normative CDISC artifact. Offered for transfer to
# CDISC governance; transfer is a single PR against this .htaccess to
# change the redirect targets. See README.md.
#
# ## Contact
# Kerstin Forsberg
# kerstin.l.forsberg@gmail.com
# GitHub username: kerfors

RewriteEngine on
RewriteBase /cdisc/cosmos

# --- Fixed paths: the contexts and the shapes graphs, at the current release.
#     First, so they resolve whatever the Accept header says.
RewriteRule ^bc/context\.jsonld$   https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.context.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^sdtm/context\.jsonld$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_sdtm_v1.context.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^bc/shapes$            https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.shapes.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^sdtm/shapes$          https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_sdtm_v1.shapes.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^qbc/shapes$           https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.shapes.ttl [R=303,L]

# --- Version IRIs: <graph>/X.Y.Z resolves to release vX.Y.Z of that graph.
#     One generic block per graph; a release needs no change here.
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^bc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^bc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^bc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^bc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/index.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^bc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^qbc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^qbc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^qbc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^qbc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/index.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^qbc/instances/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^bc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^bc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^bc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^bc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/index.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^bc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_bc_v1.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^sdtm/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_sdtm_v1.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^sdtm/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_sdtm_v1.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^sdtm/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_sdtm_v1.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^sdtm/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/index.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^sdtm/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_sdtm_v1.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^qbc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^qbc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^qbc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^qbc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/index.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^qbc/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/v$1/cosmos_qbc_v1.ttl [R=303,L]

# --- Ontology IRIs (segment root, with or without the slash) and, for the
#     overlay, its terms: the classes and properties the T-Box declares,
#     read from cosmos_qbc_v1.ttl by 80_generate_htaccess.ipynb (44 at v0.3.0).
#     A browser gets the WIDOCO description; an RDF client gets the ontology.
#     Three overlay terms carry no rdfs:label and so have no anchor in the page
#     (gen-owl emits a bare declaration for a name declared on more than one
#     class - overlay schema, D19); those land at the top of it.
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^bc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^bc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^bc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^bc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/doc-cosmos_bc_v1/index-en.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^bc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^qbc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^qbc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^qbc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^qbc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/doc-cosmos_qbc_v1/index-en.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^qbc/?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^qbc/(AssignedTerm|ConceptTerm|ExternalMapping|InterpretationRegimeAssertion|MappingRelationEnum|QualifiedBiomedicalConcept|QualifiedBiomedicalConceptCollection|Recording|ResultScale|SemanticValueSetTerm|admissibleSpecimens|broaderConceptId|code|comment|conceptId|domain|externalMappings|interpretationRegimes|iri|loincPins|ncitCode|permissibleValue|preferredTerm|qualifierDataElementConcepts|recordingId|recordings|regime|relation|resultCodelistBinding|resultDataElementConcept|resultScale|resultScales|semanticValueSet|siblingIri|siblings|sourceAnchor|specimen|stateDataElementConceptId|stateValue|system|testCode|unitCodelistBinding|value|variableOverrides)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^qbc/(AssignedTerm|ConceptTerm|ExternalMapping|InterpretationRegimeAssertion|MappingRelationEnum|QualifiedBiomedicalConcept|QualifiedBiomedicalConceptCollection|Recording|ResultScale|SemanticValueSetTerm|admissibleSpecimens|broaderConceptId|code|comment|conceptId|domain|externalMappings|interpretationRegimes|iri|loincPins|ncitCode|permissibleValue|preferredTerm|qualifierDataElementConcepts|recordingId|recordings|regime|relation|resultCodelistBinding|resultDataElementConcept|resultScale|resultScales|semanticValueSet|siblingIri|siblings|sourceAnchor|specimen|stateDataElementConceptId|stateValue|system|testCode|unitCodelistBinding|value|variableOverrides)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^qbc/(AssignedTerm|ConceptTerm|ExternalMapping|InterpretationRegimeAssertion|MappingRelationEnum|QualifiedBiomedicalConcept|QualifiedBiomedicalConceptCollection|Recording|ResultScale|SemanticValueSetTerm|admissibleSpecimens|broaderConceptId|code|comment|conceptId|domain|externalMappings|interpretationRegimes|iri|loincPins|ncitCode|permissibleValue|preferredTerm|qualifierDataElementConcepts|recordingId|recordings|regime|relation|resultCodelistBinding|resultDataElementConcept|resultScale|resultScales|semanticValueSet|siblingIri|siblings|sourceAnchor|specimen|stateDataElementConceptId|stateValue|system|testCode|unitCodelistBinding|value|variableOverrides)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^qbc/(AssignedTerm|ConceptTerm|ExternalMapping|InterpretationRegimeAssertion|MappingRelationEnum|QualifiedBiomedicalConcept|QualifiedBiomedicalConceptCollection|Recording|ResultScale|SemanticValueSetTerm|admissibleSpecimens|broaderConceptId|code|comment|conceptId|domain|externalMappings|interpretationRegimes|iri|loincPins|ncitCode|permissibleValue|preferredTerm|qualifierDataElementConcepts|recordingId|recordings|regime|relation|resultCodelistBinding|resultDataElementConcept|resultScale|resultScales|semanticValueSet|siblingIri|siblings|sourceAnchor|specimen|stateDataElementConceptId|stateValue|system|testCode|unitCodelistBinding|value|variableOverrides)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/doc-cosmos_qbc_v1/index-en.html#$1 [R=303,L,NE]
RewriteRule ^qbc/(AssignedTerm|ConceptTerm|ExternalMapping|InterpretationRegimeAssertion|MappingRelationEnum|QualifiedBiomedicalConcept|QualifiedBiomedicalConceptCollection|Recording|ResultScale|SemanticValueSetTerm|admissibleSpecimens|broaderConceptId|code|comment|conceptId|domain|externalMappings|interpretationRegimes|iri|loincPins|ncitCode|permissibleValue|preferredTerm|qualifierDataElementConcepts|recordingId|recordings|regime|relation|resultCodelistBinding|resultDataElementConcept|resultScale|resultScales|semanticValueSet|siblingIri|siblings|sourceAnchor|specimen|stateDataElementConceptId|stateValue|system|testCode|unitCodelistBinding|value|variableOverrides)$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.ttl [R=303,L]

# --- Every other IRI under bc/ or qbc/ is an individual - a category label-node,
#     a (concept, DEC) pair, a qualified concept, a scale node, a use-node - and
#     resolves to the instance graph that has it as subject.
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^bc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^bc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^bc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^bc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/index.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^bc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_bc_v1.instances.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^qbc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^qbc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^qbc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^qbc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/index.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^qbc/.+ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_qbc_v1.instances.ttl [R=303,L]

# --- sdtm/ has no instance graph (decision D4): the root and anything under it
#     resolve to the ontology. The class and property IRIs of the core rendering
#     are CDISC's own https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/ strings and are not served here,
#     so there is no per-term rule to write for this segment.
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^sdtm(/.*)?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_sdtm_v1.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^sdtm(/.*)?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_sdtm_v1.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^sdtm(/.*)?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_sdtm_v1.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^sdtm(/.*)?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/doc-cosmos_sdtm_v1/index-en.html [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^sdtm(/.*)?$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/latest/cosmos_sdtm_v1.ttl [R=303,L]

# --- Namespace root: no single graph describes the whole namespace; the site's
#     release index does. (Not the repository README: a fragment in a redirect
#     target gets percent-encoded by mod_rewrite unless flagged NE, and GitHub
#     answers %23readme with 400 - measured live 2026-09-04.)
RewriteRule ^$ https://kerfors.github.io/cosmos-rdf/index.html [R=303,L]

# dss/ deliberately has no rule (see header): unmatched, it falls through to
# the w3id 404 until the Dataset Specialization layer lands (D4).
